    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "content": "### SCFM to ACFM Calculation\n\n**Formula:**\nACFM = SCFM × (Pstd / (Pact - Psat × Φ)) × (Tact / Tstd)\n\nWhere:\n- SCFM = Standard Cubic Feet per Minute\n- Pstd = Standard absolute air pressure (14.696 psia)\n- Pact = Absolute pressure at actual level (psia)\n- Psat = Saturation pressure at actual temperature (psi)\n- Φ = Relative humidity (0-1)\n- Tact = Actual ambient air temperature (°R)\n- Tstd = Standard temperature (520 °R)",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "scfm",
          "label": "SCFM (Standard CFM)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "CFM"
        },
        {
          "id": "pstd",
          "label": "Standard Pressure (Pstd)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 14.696,
          "unit": "psia"
        },
        {
          "id": "pact",
          "label": "Actual Pressure (Pact)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 12.23,
          "unit": "psia"
        },
        {
          "id": "psat",
          "label": "Saturation Pressure (Psat)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.5069,
          "unit": "psia"
        },
        {
          "id": "humidity",
          "label": "Relative Humidity (Φ)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.8,
          "unit": "ratio"
        },
        {
          "id": "tact",
          "label": "Actual Temperature (Tact)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 540,
          "unit": "°R"
        },
        {
          "id": "tstd",
          "label": "Standard Temperature (Tstd)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 520,
          "unit": "°R"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "acfm",
          "label": "ACFM (Actual CFM)",
          "formula": "inputs.scfm * (inputs.pstd / (inputs.pact - inputs.psat * inputs.humidity)) * (inputs.tact / inputs.tstd)",
          "unit": "CFM",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "content": "### ACFM to ICFM Calculation\n\n**Formula:**\nICFM = ACFM × (Pact / Pf) × (Tf / Tact)\n\nWhere:\n- ACFM = Actual Cubic Feet per Minute\n- Pact = Actual pressure (psia)\n- Pf = Pressure after filter or inlet equipment (psia)\n- Tf = Temperature after filter or inlet equipment (°R)\n- Tact = Actual ambient air temperature (°R)",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "acfm_input",
          "label": "ACFM (Actual CFM)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 129.1,
          "unit": "CFM"
        },
        {
          "id": "pact_icfm",
          "label": "Actual Pressure (Pact)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 12.23,
          "unit": "psia"
        },
        {
          "id": "pf",
          "label": "Pressure After Filter (Pf)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 11.73,
          "unit": "psia"
        },
        {
          "id": "tf",
          "label": "Temperature After Filter (Tf)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 540,
          "unit": "°R"
        },
        {
          "id": "tact_icfm",
          "label": "Actual Temperature (Tact)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 540,
          "unit": "°R"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "icfm",
          "label": "ICFM (Inlet CFM)",
          "formula": "inputs.acfm_input * (inputs.pact_icfm / inputs.pf) * (inputs.tf / inputs.tact_icfm)",
          "unit": "CFM",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
